<title>USA: U.S. cash soymeal - Higher CBOT values slow sales.</title>
<headline>U.S. cash soymeal - Higher CBOT values slow sales.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The jump in CBOT soymeal futures Friday and Monday dampened buyer interest for cash soymeal in many areas, soymeal dealers said.</p>
<p>Crushing operations were mostly unaffected by the frigid weather blanketing the U.S. Midwest. However, one soymeal source said some crush operations may slow slightly to prevent breakdowns, which would take longer to repair in the cold.</p>
<p>Soymeal basis values were mixed, with reductions attributed to higher CBOT futures. The few increases were attributed to strong feed demand, with feed mixers buying only what they need.  </p>
